### Ollama endpoint collection used by document-analyzer

@ollamaBase = http://localhost:11434
@ollamaImageUrl = https://example.invalid/image.png

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Health / discovery
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Tags (used by readiness health adapter)
GET {{ollamaBase}}/api/tags
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Embeddings (used by OllamaEmbeddingClient)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Batch embeddings endpoint
POST {{ollamaBase}}/api/embeddings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "input": [
    "The cat sat on the mat.",
    "The dog sat on the log."
  ],
  "model": "qwen3-embedding:4b"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Text generation (used by text generation + contextual summarizer)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Generate answer text (non-stream)
POST {{ollamaBase}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "model": "gemma4:e4b",
  "prompt": "Answer in one sentence: who sits on the mat?",
  "stream": false
}

### Generate summary-style text (non-stream)
POST {{ollamaBase}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "model": "gemma4:e4b",
  "prompt": "Summarize this in neutral encyclopedic style: The hero arrives, faces danger, and wins.",
  "stream": false
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Image generation (used by OllamaImageProvider)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### OpenAI-compatible image generation endpoint
POST {{ollamaBase}}/v1/images/generations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "model": "gemma4:e4b",
  "prompt": "A dramatic fantasy castle at dusk, cinematic composition"
}

>> ./resources/output/ollama_image_generation_response.json

> {%
  if (response.body && response.body.data && response.body.data.length > 0 && response.body.data[0].url) {
    client.global.set("ollamaImageUrl", response.body.data[0].url);
  }
%}

### Download generated image when response provides data[0].url
GET {{ollamaImageUrl}}
Accept: image/*

>> ./resources/output/ollama_generated_image.bin

